---- MODULE live_branch_and_sink__weak__quantified_empty ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLE x
Next == \/ x = 0 /\ x' \in {1, 2}
        \/ x = 1 /\ x' = 0
        \/ x = 2 /\ x' = 2
Spec == x = 0 /\ [][Next]_x /\ WF_x(Next)
Prop == \A v \in {} : <>(x = v)
====

